su name love teaching be refinery def
su name manuscript ob text "Write a spoken teaching manuscript that teaches people how to love God. Focus on concrete actions humans can take to love God (prayer, obedience, gratitude, trust). Do not focus on God loving people. Target about 90 words, plain language, no lists, no markdown." for name mind to name text manuscript out be write do
su name telling from ve name manuscript ob name manuscript out to filename "examples/out/love-of-god-30s.wav" be piper say do
su name footnote from ve name telling from filename "examples/out/love-of-god-30s.wav" become wo srt to filename "examples/out/love-of-god-30s.srt" be hear do
su name report from ve name footnote ob text "Generated examples/out/love-of-god-30s.wav and examples/out/love-of-god-30s.srt" be write do
prah

from name love teaching be refinery do
ob text "Refinery run complete. Checking outputs..." be write do
ob text "head -n 8 examples/out/love-of-god-30s.srt" to name text srt preview be command do
ob name srt preview be write do
